# IDE
.idea/

# Build output
**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/

# BenchmarkDotNet
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# Timestamped local benchmark runs; named labels (validated/, release/) are committed receipts
benchmarks/*/results/20*
benchmarks/Alpha/results/final/full/
benchmarks/Alpha/results/final/focused/
benchmarks/Alpha/results/final/replicate3/
benchmarks/Alpha/results/final/**/*.log
benchmarks/Alpha/results/final/**/*.csv
benchmarks/Alpha/results/final/**/*.html

# Generated fixtures — regenerated by `dotnet run --project benchmarks/Generate -- .`
# (and GenerateHooks for ReceiverLink) when missing; index data stays tracked under Generate/Data
benchmarks/*/Generated/
benchmarks/Dispatch/ReceiverLink.g.cs

# Rider per-user settings
*.DotSettings.user
__pycache__/
!benchmarks/FusionHour/Generated/
!benchmarks/ConsumerFusion/Generated/

# agent loop transport (authority lives in issue #56)
/NEXT-TASK.md
/WORK-REPORT.md
/.tl-loop/
